    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d678">

                <pb facs="0715" n="611" xml:id="pg611"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">816.01/240: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Chargé in El Salvador</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >McCafferty</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of State </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">San Salvador</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1932-09-24T15:00:00-06:00">September 24,
                            1932—3 p.m.</date>
                        <lb/> [Received 6:20 p.m.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>103. Referring to my telegram No. 102 of September 22, 3 p.m.,<anchor n="30"
                        xml:id="d678-f1"/> the Spanish Chargé d’Affaires informed me that upon
                    instructions from his Government he had recognized the Martínez regime by formal
                    note this morning.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">McCafferty</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
